                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "When a baby\u2019s health is in danger, it\u2019s on everyone to act.\n\nI spoke with the @US_FDA commissioner this morning about the recall. The administration and Iowa suppliers moved quickly to protect families nationwide, exactly how government and industry should work together.\n\nThank you, ByHeart, for taking swift action to recall formula and safeguard babies\u2019 health across Iowa.\n\nWe\u2019re proud to lead the Infant Formula Made in America Act to strengthen U.S. production, diversify the supply chain, and ensure every parent can access safe, high-quality formula.",
